<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Storm Gate</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: none (no guild teaches it)
Mana: 15
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast storm gate &lt;gate&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster raises a clenched fist, mumbles 'Oofquah' and calls on the 
forces of nature to open a storm gate. It was made for the storm gates 
that once led to the Ivory Paths; those gates are no longer in the world, 
so today the spell opens nothing. Cast on anything else, you only pretend 
that it is a storm gate.
</p><p>No guild teaches it, but it can still turn up on wands and scrolls among 
random treasure.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>